  "thesis": {
    "statement": "Tanzania's tax gap is not a detection problem — it is a relationship problem. TRA currently operates as a Debt Collector arriving at the end of the citizen lifecycle. Transforming TRA into a Civic Partner from birth produces sustainable voluntary compliance that no enforcement strategy can match. Behavioral lifecycle interventions represent the highest-leverage, lowest-cost path to closing Tanzania's 4.1% GDP tax gap.",
